  "body": "Just a short stroll from beaches, coastal walkways and local parks, this brand new home combines an enviable coastal lifestyle with the space and flexibility modern families are looking for.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed over three generous levels, with the convenience of a private lift servicing every floor, this beautifully appointed home offers effortless living for growing families, multi-generational households, or those simply wanting room to spread out. Expansive sea views from the second and third levels provide a stunning backdrop to everyday life.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold 207sqm (approx.) site with a generous 247sqm (approx.) floor area, the home offers:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Flexible fifth bedroom or home office\r\n* Full bathroom plus separate toilet\r\n* Private deck flowing to a fully fenced backyard and side courtyard\r\n\r\nSecond Floor\r\n* Three generous bedrooms, including a master suite with ensuite\r\n* Stylish family bathroom\r\n* Beautiful sea views\r\n\r\nTop Floor\r\n* Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living capturing spectacular sea views\r\n* Additional bedroom\r\n* Guest powder room\r\n* An outstanding space for entertaining family and friends\r\n\r\nPremium Features\r\n* Freehold title\r\n* Five bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms\r\n* Private lift servicing all three levels\r\n* Designer kitchen with premium Miele appliances\r\n* Kohler tapware and Villeroy & Boch bathroom fittings\r\n* Central air conditioning\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Fully fenced backyard with entertaining deck\r\n* Zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n\r\nA Rare Coastal Opportunity - Limited Homes Available! Six high-quality homes, with three already under contract!\r\n\r\nCurrent Project Availability:\r\n\r\n17A (Lot 1) - Under Contract\r\n\r\n17C (Lot 6) - Under Contract\r\n\r\n17D (Lot 5) - Under Contract\r\n\r\n17B (Lot 4) - Available Now: https://www.trademe.co.nz/a/property/new-homes/new-house/auckland/north-shore-city/torbay/listing/6191653029\r\n\r\n17E (Lot 2) - Available Now: https://www.trademe.co.nz/a/property/new-homes/new-house/auckland/north-shore-city/torbay/listing/6060498974\r\n\r\n17F (Lot 3) - Coming Soon\r\n\r\nWith three homes already under contract, now is the time to secure your place in this sought-after coastal development.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity to enjoy beautiful sea views and a relaxed coastal lifestyle, just moments from the beach!\r\n\r\nYour Next Move Starts Here!!!",
